Subject: a simulated path may duplicate datagrams
Why: Quiver's simulation of its persisted class (kiln's CP-T2.2 step 6, AC-T2.2.5) needs duplicated messages on the fabric; offered upstream on cp/t2.2-told (d59ae5f)

